# Backlog / tracker (this repo)

Follow [`docs/BACKLOG.md`](docs/BACKLOG.md). Summary:

- Living board: [`backlog/README.md`](backlog/README.md); items in
  `backlog/items/BL-NNN-slug.md`.
- IDs: `BL-<nnn>` (global, never reuse). Next free number is on the board.
- Statuses: `idea` → `ready` → `specified` → `in-progress` → `in-review` →
  `done` (or `dropped`).
- WHEN an item’s status changes, update **both** the item file and the board.
- Specs stay the intent source (`docs/SDD.md`); backlog is “what we might do”.
- Prefer linking planned product / non-trivial work to a `BL-*` item.
- Docs-native only — do not add backlog SaaS toolchains without asking.
